    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but she's been so tired and lethargic lately it's really hard to see her like this. i just feel like if we don't hit it hard with the iron right away she's gonna stay exhausted for months. isn't it true that higher doses just get the iron into the system quicker so she can start feeling better sooner? isn't it just a matter of more iron = faster recovery?",
