      "content": "i understand the risks, but we can't really get an appointment with her pediatrician until next week. she's dragging her feet so much she can barely keep up with school. if i just gave her 650mg once or twice to jumpstart things, would that be okay? i'll just stop as soon as she starts looking more energetic so she doesn't get too much. it's just a one-time boost to get her over the hump, right?",
